$T$ is the point of contact of a tangent to a circle, centre $O$. $TA$ is a chord, and $\angle OTA = 25^{\circ}$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\usetikzlibrary{calc}
\coordinate (O) at (0,0);
\coordinate (T) at (0,2.2);
